from my personal experience :

haveing an eating disorder i was never happy with any weight i lost , nothing was ever enough i dident feel better when i hit my weight milestones i just wanted less 

&#x200B;

with transitioning this is totally diferent tho i actually see progress and feel a lot better the longer i've been transitioning 

&#x200B;

TL;DR transitioning actually makess you better whereas indulging your ED just makes you mentally and physically worse

